            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a refrigerator. The refrigerator, according to one embodiment of the present invention, comprises: a cabinet in which a storage space is formed; a door which opens/closes the cabinet and has an opening part communicating with the storage space; a panel assembly which is provided to the opening part and selectively becomes transparent according to an operation by a user; a sensing module which is disposed inside the panel assembly and generates a sensing signal by sensing the approaching of an object in an input region formed on the front surface of the panel assembly; and a display module which is disposed inside the panel assembly and displays, in a display region formed on the front surface of the panel assembly, information determined by means of the sensing signal, wherein the sensing module comprises a light-emitting element and a light-receiving element, the light-emitting element outputting optical signals for sensing the approaching of the object, and the light-receiving element receiving an optical signal, among the optical signals outputted by the light-emitting element, which is reflected by the object, and generating the sensing signal by receiving the optical signal.</p>
            </abstract>
